{
 "dur": 65.6,
 "vo": [
  {
   "id": "v01",
   "t": 0.3,
   "chunks": [
    "Is AI drinking",
    "the planet dry?"
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v02",
   "t": 2.84,
   "chunks": [
    "This is an AI data center.",
    "And you see, its chips",
    "run so hot",
    "they have to drink to survive."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v03",
   "t": 8.77,
   "chunks": [
    "Inside: racks of GPUs.",
    "One rack pulls",
    "120 kilowatts."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v04",
   "t": 13.38,
   "chunks": [
    "Air can't keep up.",
    "So the cooling goes",
    "straight to the chip."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v05",
   "t": 16.51,
   "chunks": [
    "Cold plates",
    "sit on every GPU.",
    "Coolant flows through,",
    "and carries the heat away."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v06",
   "t": 21.58,
   "chunks": [
    "That loop dumps its heat",
    "into a chiller.",
    "Then up to the roof."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v07",
   "t": 25.08,
   "chunks": [
    "Cooling towers.",
    "This is where water is lost.",
    "It evaporates,",
    "and the heat leaves as vapour."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v08",
   "t": 30.36,
   "chunks": [
    "How much?",
    "Operators measure",
    "litres per kilowatt-hour.",
    "Amazon reports 0.15.",
    "Microsoft, 0.27."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v09",
   "t": 38.22,
   "chunks": [
    "But that's only half the bill.",
    "Power plants drink too.",
    "In America, that hidden water",
    "is 12 times bigger."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v10",
   "t": 44.4,
   "chunks": [
    "So, one prompt?",
    "Google says",
    "about five drops."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v11",
   "t": 47.45,
   "chunks": [
    "One big data center?",
    "Up to five million gallons",
    "a day."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v12",
   "t": 51.13,
   "chunks": [
    "The fixes?",
    "Closed loops",
    "that never evaporate.",
    "Dry coolers instead of towers.",
    "And cooler climates."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v13",
   "t": 57.13,
   "chunks": [
    "Of course, one question",
    "won't drain a river.",
    "But billions a day?",
    "That adds up."
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "v14",
   "t": 61.65,
   "chunks": [
    "What should we",
    "take apart next?"
   ]
  }
 ]
}